    {
      "id": "a61388ec-f8d3-4e2c-bae7-48d23e1cf068",
      "title": "Escute a pergunta e ligue a forma em espanhol ao apoio em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "94799a3e-8fdd-4974-9f65-47b47ce2ed0f",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute a pergunta completa.</p><p><strong>¿A qué se dedica tu amiga Marta?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Com o que sua amiga Marta trabalha?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/97c11c57a0ee437993ba1fd9433ea693_l02b01-a-que-se-dedica-tu-amiga-marta.mp3?Expires=1794099574&Signature=nRPUpj5Tbg0IAIVjYLGHxGEfSQxYQ1Dm1-N~FMIK4ZaxJOhcJ3UIydZ4E3JHYVzdPHHaxXI4YxNRJkOvLqNKWx-Qd9NE5JteDJY1mPEmpbmUc~qh4v3Ygxi58pCMm2MvxFebqHXAqTU-F2h4oU9ju0n3q9syRVRwlQ9jipr-Rf9kDQFdjVz3jiJONQ~ve4a0CEINZ5ZKgYZdoG541xDzegWxvLqLGCV-p9hReaK2tL1l9DCKe8tdG~d3QsjFlV8hS~JKUe362IsPZtr5rO-9RmvF1-rM301IVxHI46T4Yjwz20~XviiBamtMd-~mKG0FcbzIc8cQPW2Emsj~EjWKkg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
