      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "79779394-ecb8-4aae-8639-ac14c97d7356",
      "title": "Escute a pergunta e note como ela pede o ponto de partida da relação.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "83084dee-b95b-4388-9fc8-3537bb7a4142",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute a segunda pergunta-chave da aula.</p><p><strong>¿Desde cuándo conoces a Marta?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Desde quando você conhece a Marta?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e41433b787e646eda531c6001fe75d01_l02b04-desde-cuando-conoces-a-marta.mp3?Expires=1794099574&Signature=hdLrsw15GX~II52NfRRiyvo4b5qSz8ZFpB1iRDeu9Dd5oyCGtLW806zggj3U9Nm5Y2kImdpwv4OuOtUWLp-n9JKCwBwuzlWfODmpODRUFdH2RGjzUimAewFl3Gi1uRgKiU0Nev1Ev-Uq--ridetXhSTcEJg-4VebK17UEXaBj~~tXhdZplbRyYuKzEpXR~Y4dtXrPqrt~t6L-SfOKwZTfZGiDn5PatBmWTkDGecpuSbbSabQB1zI8TBKkuenezFjdd8l9nXnQ6vnxe78chv3UNjo40ccmbufnwt-6BvnWWggpYUiG0KlNQmjihWEo5UffEyoIUAbhLcle7xD3wm~RA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
