    {
      "id": "573072db-6ca2-4343-bba0-20d60446f59f",
      "title": "Compare as duas respostas e observe o que muda quando você fala de começo ou de duração.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a5a51f38-7936-4b1e-8bbd-d71b0a3b42ad",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Conozco a Marta desde la universidad.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Conheço a Marta desde a universidade.</strong></p><p><strong>desde</strong> aponta o ponto de partida da relação.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e522728ecf194828b72284f081fa325e_l02b05-conozco-a-marta-desde-la-universidad.mp3?Expires=1794099574&Signature=xYHOQzFdFlGIDZrAfZDJGL17afzqRt-i8MKD7I9w2FEq8--YFTDXfdjC-5mNipDuIuPTrCV-8ZsmFC6WLXaFK59UzxiD~jvK9SMpv8bSP95CnSgqusrGkvkefAcD3jBQ9m45Bwxo3eTSSE8krXaI2sE1-xvfIiVXk4bF24N0~z-93BQ6-Uhw6ev8PRPhPZsE0g3iQch90CNW3uLo7hItTvbIzQU5wNdSpyo84hMlO5t4hCN7jzh7lDtLFy4OokpJYxsylaP6Qwu~6LMLJD9g1dQNKPPuq7nJPBj7bwmMQdS3d86zsEZ78KZIjwjk2H9pKzaAbQoanANXyx-CseGZbQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "f01c34e3-a86a-41f1-8390-6e288fab2818",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Conozco a Marta desde hace seis años.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Conheço a Marta há seis anos.</strong></p><p><strong>desde hace</strong> mostra há quanto tempo a relação dura até agora.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8949529ee2d54cdabff5794c98907496_l02b05-conozco-a-marta-desde-hace-seis-anos.mp3?Expires=1794099574&Signature=g1Bg3m6MJ0JMkZYekvz8ip5MtOFJX~dvVaQCdCbolN3y6i3Tf9jI1rpZFWhDtzFbaoEnU-cYf8RZ1ogepf50Vhqj~1SUI02W1eTuASK2G~woeCt09Hu5-5LBHFlt6shrZK-iqKUp1J7uHVjHsXGnHc63pzBpwlnXMXwwFzvz~jpo-QWyNLmyoMnM7tb58GRJsQP0H~7lJvTe7AyzLPCJeaM-icafsiz2Eu~uKNgaIuumkUfnOllrvZR13GljQzpjoB3d-NFHROWDBcLMhvOCilF0vGKqExeRl5SPvs7rcM76nnan6Jby-glQTJuH2bN35PkkAxqns4EzGSFiB5nkpw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
